<section class="backup-card backup-card-data">
  <div class="backup-head">
    <div>
      <div class="backup-title">数据备份与还原</div>
      <div class="backup-subtitle">立即触发系统数据备份，或上传 zip 文件执行全量还原。</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="backup-grid">
    <section class="backup-panel">
      <div class="panel-title">立即备份</div>
      <p class="panel-text">通过 `/api/master/manage` 触发 `trigger_backup`，用于生成最新系统备份。</p>
      <button
        id="master-data-backup-trigger"
        type="button"
        class="backup-button backup-button-primary"
        onclick="window.triggerMasterDataBackup ? window.triggerMasterDataBackup(this) : void 0"
      >
        立即备份
      </button>
      <div id="master-data-backup-feedback" class="backup-feedback backup-feedback-muted">
        备份结果会显示在这里。
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="backup-panel backup-panel-danger">
      <div class="panel-title">Zip 还原</div>
      <p class="panel-text panel-text-danger">危险操作：还原会覆盖当前系统数据，提交前会要求二次确认。</p>
      <div class="restore-row">
        <input id="master-restore-file" type="file" accept=".zip" />
        <button
          id="master-data-restore-trigger"
          type="button"
          class="backup-button backup-button-danger"
          onclick="window.triggerMasterRestore ? window.triggerMasterRestore(this) : void 0"
        >
          开始还原
        </button>
      </div>
      <div id="master-restore-feedback" class="backup-feedback backup-feedback-muted">
        未选择文件时会阻止提交；成功还原后页面会自动刷新。
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .backup-card {
    background: #fff;
